const string c3Tip = "CPI dealing range: the 08:30–09:00 high and low. NQ + ES + RTY 1-minute, 102 CPI days 2018–26 (304 symbol-days) vs normal days: the window ran a median 0.37 ADR20 (80%: 0.77) vs 0.12. After 09:00, RTH took its high by 16:14 on 74% of CPI days (normal 89%), its low 70% (87%), both 48% (77%), all held. The RTH close: above it 37% · inside 28% · below 35% (normal 48 · 10 · 42). Its direction did not carry: RTH closed the 08:30–09:00 way 48%."
const string gjTip = "Each index against its own week open (Sunday 18:00), in %, at the 08:30 release and the 09:30 open. SPLIT = they sit on different sides of their week opens, the SMT idea behind Genjutsu Kai; weak = the furthest below. NQ + ES + RTY 1-minute 2018–26: the index weakest at 08:30 was still the weakest at 16:14 on 71% of CPI days (the strongest still the strongest 78%), much as on any day (70%, 71%): relative strength carries through the day, CPI does not reset it. A split at 08:30 (29% of CPI days, 26% of others) usually stood: the odd one joined the others by 16:14 on 24% of CPI days (32% of others). A locator, not a direction call."
